SECTION 7: CLUSTER STARTUP FOR FRESH DEPLOYMENT
================================================================================

To apply these optimizations on a fresh cluster:

1. Update cluster-config.yaml with new settings
2. Delete old cluster: k3d cluster delete platform-cluster
3. Create new cluster: k3d cluster create -c infrastructure/k3d/cluster-config.yaml
4. Apply namespaces: kubectl apply -f infrastructure/namespaces.yaml
5. Install components with new values: ./scripts/start-platform.sh

This will ensure:
✅ Correct port mappings from start
✅ API server optimization flags
✅ Proper memory allocation
✅ Grafana and Rancher with sufficient resources
✅ Faster initialization and better stability

